{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40515","headline":"断火谣 · 苏拯","name":"断火谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁谓之推贤，於世何功果。\n绝尔晋侯交，禁我唐虞火。\n国闭檀榆烟，大礼成隳堕。\n暗室枯槁饭，冷面相看坐。\n阳昇既非佑，阴伏若爲佐。\n焉冻羣生腹，将止天下祸。\n但究冤滥刑，天道无不可。\n鄙哉前朝翊赞臣，訏谟之规何琐琐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}